        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-18T20:04:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Were you fighting in Freedom Tower? If not, then wait until the environment plays a target and use Savage Mana's power to destroy that target, freeing all underbosses and thugs. Or you could use Savage Mana's power to attack a hero, there are a few that can become immune to damage. Another option would be use Ongoing destruction to destroy Savage Mana.</p>",
