        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-18T20:56:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Chairman is not like Miss Information, he's still a target on his front side, just immune to damage. You could have Savaged Mana-ed and directed the damage at him to get Underbosses in his trash at any point (I would advise waiting until after the last of the Prison break cards has passed!).</p>",
